# Crawl logs

Price-check notices are rows in `public.crawl_events` (the bell in the app).

When a crawl failure needs diagnosis, run:

```
npm run logs
```

That prints the latest notices with the service role in `.env.local`. Do not ask the user to paste the bell. `npm run logs -- 200` prints a longer list.

A signed-in administrator can also open `/api/logs`.
